bai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Group developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/the-wadhwa-group-608.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# The Wadhwa Parwana Tower Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Representative image as actual visual unavailable for The Wadhwa Parwana Tower](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-parwana-tower-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Parwana Tower Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-wadhwa-parwana-tower-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Parwana Tower Lift Lobby Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-wadhwa-parwana-tower-project-lift-lobby-image1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Parwana Tower Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-parwana-tower-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**Price on Request**\n\n## About The Wadhwa Parwana Tower, Borivali West by The Wadhwa Group\n\n## The Wadhwa Parwana Tower Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for The Wadhwa Parwana Tower.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  1367 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  1563 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1726 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nThe Wadhwa Parwana Tower's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | The Wadhwa Parwana Tower | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 27350 | 30750 |\n| Mar 2026 | 37050 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 30550 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 30550 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nThe Wadhwa Parwana Tower avg. price is ₹ 27.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Hiranandani Heritage](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/hiranandani-heritage/3539/project \"Hiranandani Heritage\") | ₹ 36,750 |\n| [Hiranandani Heritage Rivona](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/hiranandani-heritage-rivona/26823/project \"Hiranandani Heritage Rivona\") | ₹ 36,750 |\n| [Kalpataru Yugdharma](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-yugdharma/28287/project \"Kalpataru Yugdharma\") | ₹ 35,500 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,750 |\n| Current Project **The Wadhwa Parwana Tower** | ₹ 27,350 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In The Wadhwa Parwana Tower | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for The Wadhwa Parwana Tower.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for The Wadhwa Parwana Tower, amounting to ₹ 1 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower ranges from ₹ 34 K to ₹ 42 K with options available for 1 BHK.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for The Wadhwa Parwana Tower moved from ₹ 30,550/sqft to ₹ 37,050/sqft, reflecting a 21.28% rise.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 31.1 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 1 Cr | ₹ 31,100 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## The Wadhwa Parwana Tower Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 1367 Sq. Ft. Apartment in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 1563 Sq. Ft. Apartment in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 1726 Sq. Ft. Apartment in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower, Mumbai.\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Rent in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower in Saibaba Nagar, Mumbai]()\n\nSaibaba Nagar, Mumbai\n\n![Arjunraje kasurde  profile picture]()\n![Arjunraje Kasurde]()\n\nAasha Properties\n\n![Smita Shah]()\n\nEst8 Lab\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of The Wadhwa Parwana Tower\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of The Wadhwa Parwana Tower to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![The Wadhwa Parwana Tower Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-wadhwa-parwana-tower-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Parwana Tower Lift Lobby Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-wadhwa-parwana-tower-project-lift-lobby-image1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Parwana Tower Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-parwana-tower-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload master plan of The Wadhwa Parwana Tower to explore layout details in Borivali West, Mumbai.\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of The Wadhwa Parwana Tower\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-partyhal-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around The Wadhwa Group Borivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to The Wadhwa Parwana Tower.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![The Wadhwa Parwana Tower](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-parwana-tower-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Smtjb Khot High School\n\n#### Saibaba Mandir Kandivali\n\n#### Navjeevan Maternity & Surgical Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of The Wadhwa Parwana Tower\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in The Wadhwa Parwana Tower From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 31.1 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2025-10-14 | Floor 8, Unit A/802 | N/A | 365 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does The Wadhwa Parwana Tower compare with similar projects?\n\n![The Wadhwa Parwana Tower project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-parwana-tower-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [The Wadhwa Parwana Tower](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/the-wadhwa-parwana-tower/56308/project \"The Wadhwa Parwana Tower\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Kalpataru Towers project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-towers-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Kalpataru Towers](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-towers/2944/project \"Kalpataru Towers\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Kalpataru Gardens 2 project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-gardens-2-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Kalpataru Gardens 2](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-gardens-2/3226/project \"Kalpataru Gardens 2\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## The Wadhwa Group Track Record\n\n![The Wadhwa Group logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/the-wadhwa-group-608.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nThe Wadhwa Group has been a prominent player in the real estate industry for over five decades. With their unwavering commitment to trust, quality, trust, excellent amenities, and cutting-edge design, they have built a solid reputation, making them one of Mumbai's prominent real estate companies.\nTheir success can be attributed to their diverse portfolio of properties that includes; landmark residential projects, shopping malls, hotels, and IT parks.\nThe commitment to excellence is reflected in every aspect of its work. They strive to create sustainable and eco-friendly developments designed to meet the evolving needs of modern-day consumers. Their properties boast premium amenities that are thoughtfully designed to enhance the overall living experience.\nThe cumulative tally of projects spans an impressive 10 million sq. ft., and they have built over 100 landmarks. Their projects have attracted a large customer base, with over 10,000 satisfied families under their belt. \nIn conclusion, The Group's success can be attributed to its unwavering commitment to quality, trust, efficiency, premium amenities, and cutting-edge design. Their impressive portfolio of properties and contribution to the transformation of Mumbai's skyline has made them a force to be reckoned with in the real estate industry.\n\n![Wadhwa Marina Vista residential project in Pali Hill](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-wadhwa-marina-vista-project-flagship-opt-51fa0e97-b742-4266-ac43-70a5cc60ba63.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPali Hill, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 21.93 Cr to 32.50 Cr\n\n![The Wadhwa Artek Park residential project in Bandra East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-artek-park-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBandra East, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 10.96 Cr to 16.51 Cr\n\n![The Wadhwa Venue 52 residential project in Khar West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-venue-52-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKhar West, Mumbai\n\nOffice Space\n\n₹ 4.00 Cr to 8.74 Cr\n\n![Wadhwa The Epicentre residential project in Chembur](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-wadhwa-the-epicentre-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nChembur, Mumbai\n\nOffice Space\n\n₹ 2.30 Cr to 4.30 Cr\n\n![Wadhwa The Gateway resident