idential societies in the vicinity.\n\n### How is the Borivali West Real Estate Market?\n\n For the July 2026 quarter, the average cost of multistorey apartments in Borivali West is Rs. 25,004/sq. ft, while property values range between Rs. 18,991 and Rs. 31,016/sq. ft, offering options for varied buyer segments and investors. Residential properties in Borivali West, Mumbai presently have a 2.96% rental yield. As indicated by 376 resident feedback, Borivali West has a rating of 4.16/5.For shopping and entertainment, you can visit Maxus Cinemas and Zoom Plaza Mall. MKVV and St. Francis Institute of Technology are reputed educational institutions located close enough to walk from the project.\n\nProject Summary is Ai Generated\n\nKey Highlights\n\nAmenities\n\nLift\n\nSecurity\n\nReserved Parking\n\nVisitor Parking\n\nMaintenance Staff\n\nGymnasium\n\n## Ratings & Reviews\n\n for Borivali West\n\nLocality\n\n4.2\n\nAverage Rating\n\n(376 Total Reviews)\n\nOverall Rating\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n2\n\n1\n\nEnvironment\n\n4.2/5\n\nNeighbourhood\n\nRoads\n\nSafety\n\nCleanliness\n\nCommuting\n\n4/5\n\nPublic Transport\n\nParking\n\nConnectivity\n\nTraffic\n\nPlaces of Interest\n\n4.3/5\n\nSchools\n\nHospitals\n\nRestaurants\n\nMarkets\n\nLocality Reviews\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n17/02/2026\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green Space\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green SpaceBorivali West truly feels like home. Daily needs ar... Show More\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n13/02/2026\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West blends city convenience with nature - Sanjay Gandhi Na... Show More\n\nView All Reviews (376)\n\nRating and Reviews\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n17/02/2026\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green Space\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green SpaceBorivali West truly feels like home. Daily needs ar... Show More\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n13/02/2026\n\nGreen & Conne