 on the trust and belief of our customers and stakeholders. The group is one of Mumbai’s leading real estate companies with 250+ Landmarks and is currently developing residential, commercial, and township projects spread across approximately 4.1 Million Sq.M.\n\nTimely completion of projects coupled with strong planning and design innovation gives the group an edge over its competitors. As an organization, the group is also known for its employee-friendly and professional working environment. Today, the group’s clientele comprises of over 35,000+ satisfied customers and over 150 + MNCs.\n\n[![Image 30: Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/magic-Interior_878-x-403.jpg)](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/lp/patabadlolifebadlo/?inc=pblb_web_pdp_pblbbanner_belowhibannere)\n\nIf you like Wadhwa Parwana Tower,\n\nDon't miss these similar projects\n\n![Image 31](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/logo-magic-homes-animation.svg)\n\n![Image 32: H Rishabraj  Samaj Darshan photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2024/06/11/Project-Photo-1-Samaj-Darshan-Mumbai-5103081_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹ 1.63 Cr - 2.40 Cr\n\n[H Rishabraj Samaj Darshan](https://www.magicbricks.com/h-rishabraj-samaj-darshan-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235313033303831)\n\nBorivali West\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK\n\nView Phone No.\n\n![Image 33: Modispaces Ganges  photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2022/09/13/Project-Photo-4-Modispaces-Ganges--Mumbai-5334227_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹ 1.46 Cr - 2.64 Cr\n\n[Modispaces Ganges](https://www.magicbricks.com/modispaces-ganges-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235333334323237)\n\nBorivali West\n\n3 BHK\n\nView Phone No.\n\n![Image 34: Romell Serene photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2022/08/26/Project-Photo-1-Romell-Serene-Mumbai-5330395_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹ 1.92 Cr - 2.66 Cr\n\n[Romell Serene](https://www.magicbricks.com/romell-serene-borivali-