a Parwana Tower has a total of 123 units.\n\n### How many towers in Wadhwa Parwana Tower?\n\nWadhwa Parwana Tower has a total of 3 towers in different unit configurations.\n\n### Where can I download the brochure PDF of Wadhwa Parwana Tower from?\n\nYou can [download the brochure of Wadhwa Parwana Tower](https://www.magicbricks.com/wadhwa-parwana-tower-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303437363931#nav-overview) visiting the Project page. \n\n### What is the total area of Wadhwa Parwana Tower?\n\nWadhwa Parwana Tower in Mumbai spans a total area of 2 acres.\n\n### What are other residential projects near Wadhwa Parwana Tower?\n\n[Dotom Hilton](https://www.magicbricks.com/dotom-hilton-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343139393831), [Sumit KMR Param](https://www.magicbricks.com/sumit-kmr-param-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343234303535), [Nicco Vanashri](https://www.magicbricks.com/nicco-vanashri-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343236343639), [Kalpataru Advay](https://www.magicbricks.com/kalpataru-advay-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343232383333) and [IM The Crimson](https://www.magicbricks.com/im-the-crimson-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343433373835) are other popular residential projects near Wadhwa Parwana Tower. \n\n### What is the address of Wadhwa Parwana Tower?\n\nThe address of Wadhwa Parwana Tower is Wadhwa Parwana Tower, S.V Road, Near Sai Baba Nagar, Said Baba Road, Borivali. (W). Mumbai- 400092., 400092.\n\n### Which is nearest bus stop to Wadhwa Parwana Tower?\n\nPoisar Depot Bus Stop is located near to the Wadhwa Parwana Tower. It is the only nearest bus stop & is located at a distance of 17.7 Kms.\n\nShow more\n\ni\n\nThis project was last updated on 07 September 2026\n\nQuick Links\n\n*   [Wadhwa Parwana Tower Photos Videos](https://www.magicbricks.com/wadhwa-parwana-tower-photo-videos-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303437363931)\n*   [Wadhwa Parwana Tower Amenities](https://www.magicbricks.com/wadhwa-parwana-tower-amenities-borivali-west-m